The AutomationML standard libraries in src/engine/resources/libraries are embedded byte for
byte from the NuGet package Aml.Engine.Resources (MIT License, Copyright AutomationML e.V.),
under the license above.

AMLX containers are read and written with fflate (https://github.com/101arrowz/fflate),
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 Arjun Barrett.

