(test/validation/cases holds modified copies of them), test/xml-corpus.sources.tsv of every file
in test/xml-corpus. The other test inputs are written or generated for these tests (MIT, this
repository), except test/amlobjects/amlx/Opc.Ua.Di.NodeSet2.xml.amlx, the AML library of the
OPC UA DI NodeSet published with OPC 10000-83 (UAFX), (c) OPC Foundation, no license stated in
the package. Most files are the author's own work (MIT, this repository). Of the others:
- the unit test inputs and outputs of AutomationML/AML-UA-XSLT
  (https://github.com/AutomationML/AML-UA-XSLT), MIT License, Copyright 2021 AutomationML e.V.,
  and the AutomationML standard libraries and the CAEX 3.0 schema, MIT License, Copyright
  AutomationML e.V., both under the license text above;
- NodeSets of the OPC Foundation (https://github.com/OPCFoundation/UA-Nodeset) and of
  OPCF-Members/Opc2Aml, under the OPC Foundation MIT License stated in the files;
- two manifests of p2o-lab/MTPPy (https://github.com/p2o-lab/MTPPy): MIT License, Copyright (c)
  2022 Valentin Khaydarov, Tobias Kock, Xinyu Wang;
- published examples of AutomationML e.V., the P2O-Lab of Helmut Schmidt University Hamburg,
